\title{SegreCP: Riemannian CP tensor estimation on the Segre manifold}
\description{
Riemannian gradient descent (RGD) and Riemannian Gauss--Newton (RGN) for
noisy low-CP-rank tensor estimation, the algorithms of \emph{Guaranteed Noisy CP
Tensor Recovery via Riemannian Optimization on the Segre Manifold} (NeurIPS
2026, \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.00569}). The CP components are updated
one at a time on the Segre manifold of rank-one tensors.
\code{citation("SegreCP")} gives the reference.
}
