\section{Data layout}{

Tensors are base R arrays; \code{rTensor::Tensor} objects are also accepted. A
CP tensor is a list of components \code{list(lambda, U)}, each with a weight
\code{lambda} and a list \code{U} of one factor vector per mode. In regression, the
rows of the design matrix are the vectorized covariate tensors.
}

